# item40f merge: since origin/main's item51b combat (GetFireStart/WeaponStartTrace + the
# rejection-sampled aim spread, "soldiers now hit the player on all five surveyed maps") the
# yard agent (IAController1, SeePlayer t=168.8) hits a standing player every ~2 s and the old
# dash-and-wait cadence (one goto every 6-8 s, standing at each waypoint) died at t~235
# (measured, health 150 -> 0 along the yard). The yard stretch is compressed so the player
# keeps moving (measured run speed ~400 UU/s); the punch and duct blocks keep their internal
# cadence, and every command after the duct entry keeps its original absolute time.
# item40j merge finish: the two remaining standing-under-fire stretches were re-timed the same
# way (BaseSoldier10's zone-19 strip, BaseSoldier18's hall) and the post-Porte7 tail is shifted
# 12.5 s earlier; see the measured notes at each stretch.
