# item40i: BaseSoldier1 (IAController4, Tag fbi1_pianote) is sent by TouchTrigger30 (t~179.9)
# into Patrouille at PatrolPoint3: LoopAnim 'Console', Sleep 1100, facing PatrolPoint3's yaw
# -36228 (161 deg, WNW). A fist hit calls MakeNoise(FireNoise 0.104) (XIIIWeapon.RealTraceFire
# 0x0412) and his Patrouille.HearNoise turns him (measured: the first carton punch put him in
# Acquisition at t=193.133, and he then shot the player through the duct crawl until death at
# t~246). Knock him out first, from behind: XIIIPawn.TakeDamage (0x0244) turns DTFisted into
# DTStunned when GetDamageSide >= 6 (hit behind, -0.7*CollisionRadius: +4; upper half,
# >= 0.5*CollisionHeight: +2) and the instigator carries StunningSkill. Stand ~60 UU behind
# him, aim along his facing at eye level (pitch 0) and punch.
t=186.00 switch_weapon 0
t=187.00 goto -2472 79
t=189.00 track BaseSoldier1
t=189.30 track off
t=189.30 pitch 0
t=190.50 shoot
